      "updated": 1784867586903,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Within a single channel (alpha, rc or stable), the base version\n(x.y.z) is determined by the commit with the highest bump\npriority (major > minor > patch).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Within a single channel (alpha, rc or stable), the base version (x.y.z) is determined by the commit with the highest bump priority (major > minor > patch).",
